// =====================================================================
// One-off discovery query: find the real "Current Quarter" field
// ---------------------------------------------------------------------
// Temporarily paste this into the same Power BI action ("Run a query
// against a dataset") in place of the main query, run a test, and read
// the raw outputs. It lists every column in the model whose name
// contains "quarter" or "current", with its table name.
//
// Then, in hygiene-scores.dax, update the line
//     TREATAS({"Current Quarter"}, 'Opp Id Break Down'[Current Quarter]),
// to use the [TableName] and [ColumnName] you found, e.g.
//     TREATAS({"Current Quarter"}, 'Date'[Quarter Offset Label]),
// and paste the main query back into the action.
// =====================================================================
EVALUATE
FILTER(
    SELECTCOLUMNS(
        COLUMNSTATISTICS(),
        "TableName",  [Table Name],
        "ColumnName", [Column Name]
    ),
    SEARCH("quarter", [ColumnName], 1, 0) > 0
        || SEARCH("current", [ColumnName], 1, 0) > 0
)
ORDER BY [TableName], [ColumnName]
